{"title":"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Trig)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Trig)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef7aca957cbf3c8f375b7437b66b0db4f5e96f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(0,3)--(4,0)--cycle,dot); draw((4,0)--(7,0)--(7,10)--cycle,dot); draw((0,3)--(7,10),dot); MP(&quot;C&quot;,(0,0),SW);MP(&quot;A&quot;,(0,3),NW);MP(&quot;B&quot;,(4,0),S);MP(&quot;E&quot;,(7,0),SE);MP(&quot;D&quot;,(7,10),NE); [/asy]\" width=\"192\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has a right angle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/46524e89606488f6e45826cb9428032a84a4e118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C, AC=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a5322c7f896502c208bbb4a354efc8d212620667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6adfd3ad27a2dddeb0af7131d73c33c86991e93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> has a right angle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b196f83c62ce83e5cb39f4d69af59fe42401f4da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />. Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are on opposite sides of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />. The line through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> meets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84ae51dd95ca59139201d0895df8311e612782fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> extended at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. If\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/50279c9036f28da01bb745285a4aa85a576a5254.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{DE}{DB}=\\frac{m}{n},\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"37\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/1/7214f0f0e224f24dd4f402d082f5fd03fac16a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970ce1d67bc6dd928e170bd7e8f3e5ad097f9478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 25\\quad \\text{(B) } 128\\quad \\text{(C) } 153\\quad \\text{(D) } 243\\quad \\text{(E) } 256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"345\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p><br />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the point such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c7387ef3aa3162cea3e516216d4ed946506bd30d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d29465728e92952374a857beaee91665d8dbd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> are parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, respectively, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/8/d6816609a18881fafb804083c7701e6107e0a685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE = x$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/3/b73b2fcf07847350d9573359bf13ede50c1b04b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE^2 = 169-x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"127\" height=\"15\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/d/d5d89a1251b357e7f0afbc246b0d85ba0a7ccc74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[FDEC] = x(4+\\sqrt{169-x^2}) = [ABC] + [BED] + [ABD] + [AFD] = 6 + \\dfrac{x\\sqrt{169-x^2}}{2} + 30 + \\dfrac{(x-3)(4+\\sqrt{169-x^2})}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"938\" height=\"40\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb34322ba5d4cf2d8904c7ee81af5a841574cb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x+x\\sqrt{169-x^2} = 60 + x\\sqrt{169-x^2} - 3\\sqrt{169-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />. Simplifying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f780a7dd42ba141eb3aaed80adcd9a41bf01a2c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\sqrt{169-x^2} = 60 - 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"175\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4cc422b08386d249956ec9a34c8a3f45383bb3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1521 - 9x^2 = 16x^2 - 480x + 3600$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"263\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/190e000c44b577518f9ea3461a53e0214f932bc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25x^2 - 480x + 2079 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"187\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/130d31cce7bebc92b396582a99b56d982cfacd09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\dfrac{48\\pm15}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" />. Checking, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17d0751cd122eac7a4070bd190af4a9ef7feea4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\dfrac{63}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> is the answer, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/7/6b75c05b69e18bf8d341ae70263958b9f1449b50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{DE}{DB} = \\dfrac{\\dfrac{63}{5}}{13} = \\dfrac{63}{65}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"57\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c01c3c37dc8c90e06b10d4025e8c10f075ac6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 128}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"73\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Trig.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Trig)\">Solution 3 (Trig)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Trig)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a19f20dd35edadd54a7a6e43476bbd8bc73a89ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = \\arcsin\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"170\" height=\"45\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d548b9ad05f5e2049876837dafa5443812dd0bad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBA=\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{12}{13}\\right).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"185\" height=\"43\" /> Now we are trying to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e181a7a820948962cf0d2e04ac11036723b7ac94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(\\angle DBE)=\\sin\\left((180^{\\circ}-\\angle DBC)\\right)=\\sin\\left(180^{\\circ}-\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)-\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{12}{13}\\right)\\right)=\\sin(\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)+\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{12}{13}\\right)).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"905\" height=\"45\" /> Now we use the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb300dacfcde1b57ad070409262b1743e0cd966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" /> angle sum identity, which states <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b7f63547511ae85fe936574432f4835056a1ea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(a+b)=\\sin(a)\\cos(b)+\\cos(a)\\sin(b).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"317\" height=\"18\" /> Using this identity yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a0db02d113cf4fce6c9cb6039f25b842172cde9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\left(\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\right)\\cos\\left(\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{12}{13}\\right)\\right)+\\cos\\left(\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\right)\\sin\\left(\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{12}{13}\\right)\\right).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"622\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME\" title=\"1991 AHSME\">1991 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180757\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 276/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8322/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.637      1 -total\n 56.11%    7.652      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 42.38%    5.779      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12976:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017180757 and revision id 271398. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}